<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 75,796.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 75,796.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of Nov 15 totaled 75,796 bales, up from 75,453 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 768 bales issued, 5,280 decertification orders, 425 cancellations, and 360 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>--New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
